# Programs small by design: nothing in them is an input the compiler could fold. name<TAB>reason
os_console	OS shim test: the program is two write calls on a literal
os_exit	OS shim test: the program is report, exit, report
long_double_stride	ABI layout test: it reports sizeof and an address difference, constants by definition
fsgs_call_callee	callee-only file with no main: the other half of a link test, nothing to fold
watcom_far_sum_callee	callee-only file with no main: the other half of a link test, nothing to fold
mem_length_boundaries_src	callee-only file with no main: the other half of a link test, nothing to fold
